# Finite WDEVPWR leaves used by the source-owned Embassy station wake policy.
# The vendor PM state machine, RF callbacks, timers, locks, mesh and statistics
# remain explicit architectural replacements rather than part of this slice.
default-disposition not-yet-ported
default-protocol wifi

function libpp pwr_hal_set_mac_modem_beacon_miss_timeout
disposition direct
protocol wifi
rust-component open_esp_radio_esp32s31_pac::generated::pwr_hal_set_mac_modem_beacon_miss_timeout
binding v1
rust-probe open_libpp_power_trace_pwr_hal_set_mac_modem_beacon_miss_timeout
effect-contract exact-effects-v1
effect mmio-read 32 0x2010d854 required
effect mmio-write 32 0x2010d854 required

